---
---
<!-- SECTION: HOW WE MAKE THE CONNECTIONS (THE CLINICAL CONNECTION MODEL) -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 bg-white border-y border-brand-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-brand-orchid">The Platform Connection Flow</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">
        How We Connect Clients with Pre-Vetted Therapy Teams
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
        Unlike traditional clinics that assign whoever happens to be free, we curate complete <strong
          >clinical duos</strong
        > based on geographic proximity, neurodiversity-affirming philosophies, and specific developmental goals.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Banner: Old Bureaucratic Way vs. Side by Side Connect -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="bg-rose-50/60 border border-rose-200/80 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-200 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm"
            >✕</span
          >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-rose-950">The Traditional Agency Runaround</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-rose-900/80 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Months on opaque waitlists with zero clinician transparency.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
            <span
              >Unregulated "tiered" supervision where senior staff—not licensed RBAs—oversee delivery (violating CPBAO
              Standard 4.9).</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Therapists frequently rotated, causing regression and lost rapport for your child.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-orchid/30 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-orchid text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm"
            >✓</span
          >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-dark">The Side by Side Connection Advantage</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-bold">•</span>
            <span
              >Direct match with a paired Instructor Therapist & Supervising R.B.A. (Ont.) before your first session
              begins.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-bold">•</span>
            <span
              >CPBAO Standard 4.4 Supervision Agreement signed on day one; direct RBA oversight for 100% of cases.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Dedicated, consistent in-home sessions in your kitchen, living room, and local playground.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step-by-Step 4 Phase Process -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-orchid/10 text-brand-orchid font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4"
        >
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Needs & Goal Intake</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Tell us about your child's age, sensory profile, communication needs, school schedule, and your OAP or
          insurance status.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-ocean/10 text-brand-ocean font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4"
        >
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Clinical Team Match</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We connect you with an available Instructor Therapist in your neighbourhood paired with a supervising R.B.A.
          (Ont.).
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-berry/10 text-brand-berry font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4"
        >
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Team Consultation</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Meet your team via a secure virtual consultation. Review the Behaviour Service Plan (BSP) and assent-based
          goals before committing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="relative bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-amethyst/10 text-brand-amethyst font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4"
        >
          04
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">In-Home Therapy Begins</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Therapy begins in your natural environment with ongoing live RBA supervision, real-time data graphing, and
          automated OAP invoices.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
